# Customer routes: MechanicOnly (401 unauthenticated on all 8), DELETE adds AdminOnly (a plain mechanic gets 403 before any
# lookup). The 403 for an authenticated non-mechanic cannot be produced live (see tests/CLAUDE.md Coverage Anchors).

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@NonAdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_EMAIL}}
@NonAdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@GhostCustomerId = 999999999

### [Setup][Customers] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Customers] Login as admin (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Customers] Create the disposable customer the checks address (201 expected)
# @name authzCustomer
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Authz", "middleName": null, "lastName": "Customer", "email": "customers.authz.{{RunId}}@example.test", "phoneNumber": null }

?? status == 201

###

### [Setup][Customers] Logout before the unauthenticated checks (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Negative][Customers] Unauthenticated GET /api/customers (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Customers] Unauthenticated GET /api/customers/by-email (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/by-email?email=customers.authz.{{RunId}}@example.test

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Customers] Unauthenticated GET /api/customers/by-license-plate (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/by-license-plate?licensePlate=ABC-101

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Customers] Unauthenticated GET /api/customers/by-name (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/by-name?name=Authz

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Customers] Unauthenticated GET /api/customers/{id} (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{authzCustomer.id}}

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Customers] Unauthenticated POST /api/customers (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Anon", "middleName": null, "lastName": "Customer", "email": "customers.anon.{{RunId}}@example.test", "phoneNumber": null }

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Customers] Unauthenticated PUT /api/customers/{id} (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{authzCustomer.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Anon", "middleName": null, "lastName": "Customer", "email": "customers.authz.{{RunId}}@example.test", "phoneNumber": null }

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Customers] Unauthenticated DELETE /api/customers/{id} (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{authzCustomer.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 401

###

### [Setup][Customers] Login as the plain mechanic (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{NonAdminEmail}}", "password": "{{NonAdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Customers] Mechanic lists customers (200 expected, paged shape)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers?pageSize=1

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.pageSize == 1
?? js response.parsedBody.items.length == 1
?? js (response.parsedBody.totalCount >= 1) == true

###

### [Positive][Customers] Mechanic reads one customer (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{authzCustomer.id}}

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.id == authzCustomer.id) == true
?? js response.parsedBody.email == customers.authz.{{RunId}}@example.test

###

### [Positive][Customers] Mechanic creates a customer (201 expected)
# @name createdByMechanic
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Mechanic", "middleName": null, "lastName": "Made", "email": "customers.mechanic.made.{{RunId}}@example.test", "phoneNumber": null }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.lastName == Made

###

### [Positive][Customers] Mechanic updates a customer (204 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{authzCustomer.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Authz", "middleName": null, "lastName": "Edited", "email": "customers.authz.{{RunId}}@example.test", "phoneNumber": null }

?? status == 204

###

### [Negative][Customers] Mechanic cannot delete a customer (403 expected, AdminOnly)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{authzCustomer.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 403

###

### [Positive][Customers] The refused delete left the customer in place with the mechanic's edit (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{authzCustomer.id}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.lastName == Edited

###

### [Negative][Customers] The delete is refused before any lookup, so a missing id is 403 too (403 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{GhostCustomerId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 403

###

### [Setup][Customers] Login as admin for the cleanup deletes (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Cleanup][Customers] Delete the disposable customer (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{authzCustomer.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Cleanup][Customers] Delete the customer the mechanic created (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{createdByMechanic.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
